%
o9071 (RECOVER BOLT CIRCLE FROM PROBED OFFSETS)
(CALL WITH G54.1 P1 ACTIVE AND CANNED CYCLE ACTIVE)
(G54.1 P1 = BOLT CIRCLE CENTER)
(G54.1 P2 = PROBED HOLE CENTER)
(D = NOMINAL BOLT CIRCLE DIAMETER - ACTIVE UNITS)
(A = NUMBER OF HOLES)
(Q = RADIAL DEVIATION TOLERANCE - DEFAULT 0.002 ACTIVE UNITS)
(EXAMPLE: G65 P9071 D2.0 A6)
IF[#7 EQ #0] GOTO9901 (D GIVEN?)
IF[#7 LE 0] GOTO9901 (D POSITIVE?)
IF[#1 EQ #0] GOTO9902 (A GIVEN?)
IF[#1 NE FUP[#1]] GOTO9902 (A INTEGER?)
IF[#1 LE 0] GOTO9903 (A POSITIVE?)
IF[#17 EQ #0] THEN #17 = 0.002 (DEFAULT RADIAL TOLERANCE)
IF[#17 LT 0] GOTO9904 (Q NON-NEGATIVE?)
(OFFSET DIFFERENCE: P2 MINUS P1)
#30 = #7021 - #7001 (HOLE DELTA X)
#31 = #7022 - #7002 (HOLE DELTA Y)
#32 = SQRT[#30*#30 + #31*#31] (MEASURED RADIUS)
IF[#32 EQ 0] GOTO9906 (PROBED HOLE OFFSET DIFFERENT?)
#33 = ABS[#32 - #7/2] (RADIUS DEVIATION)
IF[#33 GT #17] GOTO9905 (NOMINAL RADIUS CHECK)
#30 = ATAN[#31]/[#30] (START ANGLE, FULL QUADRANT)
IF[#30 LT 0] THEN #30 = #30 + 360
(CALL BOLT CIRCLE MACRO AT G54.1 P1 CENTER)
G65 P9070 I#32 J#30 A#1 X0. Y0.
M99
(ERROR HANDLING)
N9901 #3000=201 (NOMINAL DIAMETER D REQUIRED AND POSITIVE)
N9902 #3000=202 (HOLE COUNT A REQUIRED AND INTEGER)
N9903 #3000=203 (HOLE COUNT A MUST BE POSITIVE)
N9904 #3000=204 (TOLERANCE Q MUST BE NON-NEGATIVE)
N9905 #3000=205 (MEASURED RADIUS OUT OF TOLERANCE)
N9906 #3000=206 (PROBED HOLE OFFSET MUST DIFFER FROM CENTER)
%
